{
  "_notes": [
    "Tool servers are global in Open WebUI, not per-workspace, so whichever workspace ships this",
    "file sets them for the whole instance. Posting replaces the whole list.",
    "Capture the real shape from an instance you configured by hand, then drop _notes:",
    "  curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer $OPEN_WEBUI_TOKEN\" http://localhost:3080/api/v1/configs/tool_servers",
    "Each server is an OpenAPI endpoint reachable from the open-webui container, so use the compose",
    "service name as the host, not localhost. Keep the code for these in git as its own service.",
    "Never put a real key in here; this repo is public. Use ${VAR} and substitute before seeding."
  ],
  "TOOL_SERVER_CONNECTIONS": [
    {
      "url": "http://appsec-tools:8000",
      "path": "openapi.json",
      "auth_type": "bearer",
      "key": "",
      "config": { "enable": true }
    }
  ]
}
